## Mandatory Self-Check Checklist

After writing or updating code, verify every item before presenting to the user:

- [ ] **No Banned Characters**: No em-dashes (`—`), en-dashes (`–`), or arrows (`→`) in any added/modified copy.
- [ ] **Bilingual Parity**: Every key added to `messages/en.json` is mirrored in `messages/ar.json`.
- [ ] **Paired Docs**: Every doc page exists in both `.mdx` and `.ar.mdx`.
- [ ] **SEO Title Brand Invariant**: No `"Cashvio"` or `"| Cashvio"` in meta title strings.
- [ ] **No PWA / No Competitors**: Manifest remains `display: 'browser'`, zero competitor names.
- [ ] **Async Params**: Page and layout `params` are awaited before property access.
- [ ] **`setRequestLocale`**: Called at the top of every localized page and layout.
- [ ] **Locale Navigation**: Links use `Link` from `@/i18n/navigation`, not bare `next/link`.
- [ ] **Type-check & Preflight**: Passed `npm run type-check` and `node .agents/skills/seo-preflight/scripts/check-content.mjs`.

If any check fails, fix the violation immediately before finishing the turn.
